---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import Barcode from './Barcode.astro';

const stock = [
  { n: 'Gaseosa 1,5 L', u: 30, w: 78, c: 'bg-emerald-500' },
  { n: 'Leche 1 L', u: 24, w: 62, c: 'bg-emerald-500' },
  { n: 'Arroz 500 g', u: 5, w: 14, c: 'bg-amber-500' },
];

const week = [
  { d: 'Lun', h: 42 },
  { d: 'Mar', h: 50 },
  { d: 'Mié', h: 46 },
  { d: 'Jue', h: 62 },
  { d: 'Vie', h: 78 },
  { d: 'Sáb', h: 100, best: true },
  { d: 'Dom', h: 68 },
];

const payments = ['Efectivo', 'Tarjeta', 'Transferencia', 'Pago mixto'];
const iconBox = 'grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-brand/12 text-brand-text';
const card = 'bento-card flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden p-6 md:p-7';
const title = 'mt-5 text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight';
const copy = 'mt-2 max-w-md text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft';
---
<section id="funciones" class="py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p class="eyebrow">Todo en un solo lugar</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-[clamp(2rem,4.6vw,3.4rem)] leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.03em]">
        <span class="font-light">Lo que tu mostrador necesita,</span>
        <span class="font-extrabold"> bien organizado.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft md:text-lg">
        Cada función vive en su propio compartimento: simple de entender, rápida de usar y conectada con todas las demás.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-6 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <!-- 1 · Cobro -->
      <div class="reveal md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-7">
        <article class={card}>
          <span class={iconBox}><Icon name="scan-barcode" class="size-5" /></span>
          <h3 class={title}>Cobra en segundos</h3>
          <p class={copy}>Escanea con un lector o con la cámara del celular, recibe el pago en efectivo, tarjeta o transferencia y deja que el sistema calcule el cambio.</p>

          <div class="mt-auto grid gap-3 pt-7 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr]">
            <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-page p-5">
              <Barcode class="h-20 w-full text-ink" />
              <span class="scan-line absolute inset-x-3 h-0.5 rounded-full bg-brand shadow-[0_0_14px_2px_var(--color-primary)]"></span>
              <p class="mt-3 text-center text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] text-ink-muted tabular-nums">7 701234 567890</p>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-page px-3.5 py-3">
                <span class="grid size-7 place-items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400"><Icon name="check" class="size-3.5" /></span>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-xs font-bold">Leche 1 L</p>
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-muted">Agregado al ticket</p>
                </div>
                <p class="ml-auto text-xs font-extrabold tabular-nums">$ 4.200</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-page px-3.5 py-3 text-xs">
                <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="font-semibold text-ink-muted">Recibido</span><span class="font-bold tabular-nums">$ 50.000</span></div>
                <div class="mt-1.5 flex justify-between"><span class="font-semibold text-ink-muted">Cambio</span><span class="font-extrabold text-brand-text tabular-nums">$ 25.900</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
                {payments.map((p) => <span class="chip !px-2.5 !py-1 !text-[11px]">{p}</span>)}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- 2 · Inventario -->
      <div class="reveal md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-5" style="--d:80ms">
        <article class={card}>
          <span class={iconBox}><Icon name="boxes" class="size-5" /></span>
          <h3 class={title}>Inventario que no miente</h3>
          <p class={copy}>Cada venta descuenta el stock al instante, incluso si varias cajas venden el mismo producto a la vez. Sin sobreventa y con alertas de stock bajo.</p>

          <div class="mt-auto space-y-3.5 pt-7">
            {stock.map((s) => (
              <div>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                  <span class="font-bold">{s.n}</span>
                  <span class="font-semibold text-ink-muted tabular-nums">{s.u} uds</span>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-1.5 h-2 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-page">
                  <div class:list={['h-full rounded-full', s.c]} style={`width:${s.w}%`}></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 pt-1">
              <span class="badge badge-warn"><Icon name="triangle-alert" class="size-3" /> Stock bajo · Arroz 500 g</span>
              <span class="chip !px-2.5 !py-1 !text-[11px]">Kardex</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 · Reportes -->
      <div class="reveal md:col-span-3 lg:col-span-4" style="--d:0ms">
        <article class={card}>
          <span class={iconBox}><Icon name="chart-column" class="size-5" /></span>
          <h3 class={title}>Reportes que se entienden</h3>
          <p class={copy}>Ventas del día, ticket promedio, facturas emitidas, tus productos estrella y tu mejor día de la semana.</p>
          <div class="mt-auto pt-7">
            <div class="flex items-end gap-2">
              {week.map((w) => (
                <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-2">
                  <div class="flex h-28 w-full items-end">
                    <div class:list={['relative w-full rounded-lg', w.best ? 'bg-brand' : 'bg-line-strong']} style={`height:${w.h}%`}>
                      {w.best && <span class="absolute -top-7 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-solid px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-solid-ink">Mejor día</span>}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase text-ink-muted">{w.d}</span>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- 4 · Compras -->
      <div class="reveal md:col-span-3 lg:col-span-4" style="--d:80ms">
        <article class={card}>
          <span class={iconBox}><Icon name="truck" class="size-5" /></span>
          <h3 class={title}>Compras y proveedores</h3>
          <p class={copy}>Registra lo que compras y el stock sube solo. Sin hojas de cálculo ni conteos dobles.</p>
          <div class="mt-auto pt-7">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-page px-3.5 py-3">
              <Icon name="truck" class="size-4 text-ink-muted" />
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold">Compra a proveedor</p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-muted">Leche 1 L · 24 uds</p>
              </div>
              <span class="badge badge-info ml-auto">Recibida</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mx-auto h-4 w-px bg-line-strong"></div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-page px-3.5 py-3">
              <Icon name="boxes" class="size-4 text-ink-muted" />
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold">Stock actualizado</p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-muted">Leche 1 L</p>
              </div>
              <span class="badge badge-ok ml-auto">+24 uds</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- 5 · Clientes -->
      <div class="reveal md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-4" style="--d:160ms">
        <article class={card}>
          <span class={iconBox}><Icon name="users" class="size-5" /></span>
          <h3 class={title}>Clientes y devoluciones</h3>
          <p class={copy}>Guarda a tus clientes con NIT o cédula para facturar en un clic y gestiona las devoluciones de venta.</p>
          <div class="mt-auto space-y-2 pt-7">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-page px-3.5 py-3">
              <span class="grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-solid text-[11px] font-extrabold text-solid-ink">MG</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold">María Gómez</p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-muted tabular-nums">CC 1.020.•••.•••</p>
              </div>
              <span class="badge badge-info ml-auto">Factura DIAN</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-page px-3.5 py-3">
              <span class="grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-full bg-line-strong text-ink-soft"><Icon name="rotate-ccw" class="size-4" /></span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold">Devolución de venta</p>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-muted">Queda registrada en el sistema</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- 6 · Multi-local -->
      <div class="reveal md:col-span-3 lg:col-span-5" style="--d:0ms">
        <article class={card}>
          <span class={iconBox}><Icon name="store" class="size-5" /></span>
          <h3 class={title}>Varios locales, cada uno a lo suyo</h3>
          <p class={copy}>Cada local trabaja con sus propios datos, aislados de los demás, y cada persona entra con el rol que le corresponde.</p>
          <div class="mt-auto pt-7">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
              {['Local Centro', 'Local Norte', 'Local Sur'].map((n, i) => (
                <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-page p-3">
                  <span class:list={['grid size-8 place-items-center rounded-xl', i === 0 ? 'bg-brand text-on-brand' : 'bg-line-strong text-ink-soft']}><Icon name="store" class="size-4" /></span>
                  <p class="mt-2 text-[11px] font-bold leading-tight">{n}</p>
                  <p class="text-[10px] text-ink-muted">Datos propios</p>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
            <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
              {['Administrador', 'Supervisor', 'Vendedor'].map((r) => <span class="chip !px-2.5 !py-1 !text-[11px]">{r}</span>)}
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- 7 · Etiquetas -->
      <div class="reveal md:col-span-3 lg:col-span-4" style="--d:80ms">
        <article class={card}>
          <span class={iconBox}><Icon name="tags" class="size-5" /></span>
          <h3 class={title}>Etiquetas con código de barras</h3>
          <p class={copy}>Genera e imprime la etiqueta Code 128 de cada producto directo desde el catálogo.</p>
          <div class="mt-auto flex justify-center pt-7">
            <div class="w-52 -rotate-2 rounded-xl bg-white p-3.5 text-neutral-900 shadow-[0_14px_34px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] ring-1 ring-black/5">
              <p class="truncate text-[11px] font-extrabold">Leche entera 1 L</p>
              <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-neutral-500 tabular-nums">LC-001 · $ 4.200</p>
              <Barcode class="mt-2 h-12 w-full text-neutral-900" pattern="3112211421123113221211411322112" />
              <p class="mt-1.5 text-center text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] tabular-nums">7701234567890</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- 8 · Celular -->
      <div class="reveal md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-3" style="--d:160ms">
        <article class={card}>
          <span class={iconBox}><Icon name="smartphone" class="size-5" /></span>
          <h3 class={title}>Instálalo en tu celular</h3>
          <p class={copy}>Se instala como app desde el navegador y escanea con la cámara.</p>
          <div class="-mb-6 mt-auto flex justify-center pt-7 md:-mb-7">
            <div class="h-40 w-28 rounded-t-[1.7rem] border-[3px] border-b-0 border-solid bg-page">
              <div class="mx-auto mt-2 h-1.5 w-9 rounded-full bg-line-strong"></div>
              <div class="space-y-1.5 p-2.5">
                <div class="grid h-16 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-solid text-solid-ink"><Icon name="camera" class="size-5" /></div>
                <div class="h-2 rounded bg-line-strong"></div>
                <div class="h-2 w-2/3 rounded bg-line-strong"></div>
                <div class="grid h-7 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-brand text-[9px] font-extrabold text-on-brand">Cobrar</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
